Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am so terribly sorry!\NI should have come with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.21,0:00:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no point in having an escort\Nfor the trials for the right to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who insisted on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are not at fault, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Darken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's return to the castle now.\NLord Rein would like to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:00:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've spoken with Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.79,0:02:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was a Minotaur summoned to the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is a demon who resides in the abyss,\Nin the deepest layers of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,In other words, this is someone's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,The source is thought to be a ring\Nfound on the corpse of a merchant at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,When Oken did his research,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,he found the magic stone in the ring\Nis of a surprisingly high purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.33,0:03:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It is something atypical\Nthat you wouldn't find on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:09.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Minotaurs are a threat level A demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wealthy folk can't just buy something\Nthat can trap a creature like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to Oken,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,the crest left on the stone\Nindicates the ring originates from
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,the Magic Empire of Deridas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course it was Deridas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's often provoked us, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Summoning and binding the princess\Nwith a barrier at the same time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,shows we must be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.92,0:03:38.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, he isn't even trying\Nto get rid of the evidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The short of it is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,not only was the enemy aiming to\Nassassinate Princess Lynneburg,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,but after that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was waiting for our country\Nto initiate a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seemed they wanted nothing more\Nthan to get what is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:04:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom's resource,\Nthe relics of the Dungeon of the Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, about the man who saved Lynne...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,With a single broadsword,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,and on top of that in a matter of seconds,\Nhe defeated the Minotaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, the secret corps followed\Nhis movements but lost sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,"He disappeared before our eyes\Nlike an illusion," or so the report says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You survived?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.79,0:04:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Last night, a demon appeared\Nnear the entrance of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was a monster like nothing\Nwe'd ever seen 'round these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was close to the construction site,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and we didn't see your face\N'round here after work, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Last night I was being followed around by\Na shady group of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so tired I went straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.21,0:05:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why's your face all dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I finished cleaning out the mud from\Nthe drain this morning before I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.08,0:05:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,In any case, you're real lucky\Nyou didn't bump into that demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.33,0:05:21.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I used to be an A-rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:24.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,and if I'd come across it\Nit'd be instant death for me, ya know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was it really that awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that one was just a cow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:34.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So what happened to that demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, seems it was taken down by a mystery man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And in one blow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are some outstanding people\Nout here in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, your payment for yesterday's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, do you still not care\Nabout gettin' yourself a decent job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,A decent job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm already working\Nas an adventurer, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:00.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.00,0:06:05.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I keep tellin' you, you can earn\N30 percent more without me taking a cut of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,At long last!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.00,0:06:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the girl from yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.67,0:06:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know it may be rude,\Nbut I just needed to meet you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:22.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I found you via\Nmy Long Distance Detection skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So then... your job class is thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.71,0:06:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, my focus is the magician class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But in addition to that,\NI have knowledge of all six skill systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're all just at a basic level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But they're so basic it's pretty embarrassing\Nto be talking to someone like you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.29,0:06:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.25,0:06:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've got an audience here,\Nso would you mind speaking outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.96,0:06:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing that would get me in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.63,0:07:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be too many people out at this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:05.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and with my Soundproofing and Concealment\Nskill no one can eavesdrop on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.75,0:07:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you don't make anymore dumb mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not sure what you mean, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, are we sure that guy actually exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:31.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can't find anyone\Nthat the secret corps didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.33,0:07:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems like they're searching for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.04,0:07:37.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they can't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me\Nfor showing up so abruptly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have demanded you join me outside\Nwhile you were speaking with the guildmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, what can I help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to properly thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I truly appreciate you saving my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not only did you save my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,what you did amounts to saving the lives\Nof many others in this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a bit of a stretch.\NYour skills are outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I may have actually\Njust interfered with your fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is simply not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.79,0:08:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what would have\Nbecome of me if you hadn't rushed in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, I accept your thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Personally, I would like to give you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:29.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,as much of a reward as possible\Nfor your help with the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to seriously compensate you\Nwith my deepest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, your gratitude from earlier\Nwas more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I truly need nothing more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.38,0:08:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, please let me thank you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,My father has also asked to meet you\Nso he can give his thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've already done more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I may not look it,\Nbut I am a person of status.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I must give something to the person\Nwho I owe my life to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:09:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-then is there anything\Nyou're having trouble with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.13,0:09:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you need, I can even talk to my father\Nabout some territory that-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I really don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:18.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have an obligation\Nto accept my gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will not move an inch\Nuntil you accept my gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will not leave until you train me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,If all I have to do\Nis meet your father, then I accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.13,0:09:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:55.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there's no need\Nfor anything extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:09:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, follow close behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want people to spot us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:08.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I'll use Concealment, Detection Occlusion,\Nand multiple other skills to hide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this... your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.13,0:10:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I do think this type of structure\Nisn't very common...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it,\NI still haven't asked for your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.50,0:10:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me? I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.50,0:10:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Noor, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.25,0:10:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,My apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot to introduce myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:56.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am Lynneburg Clays.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:11:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a lengthy name,\Nso I go by Lynne when I'm adventuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it if you'd call me Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, this is a really spacious house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's probably one of those\Nso-called wealthy people or aristocrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you don't make anymore dumb mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this what he meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's ask her where my father is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines, I'd like to see my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He is currently in the audience chambers\Nspeaking with Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who is that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's the one who risked his life\Nto save mine in that attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will lead you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she the family maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like it'd be rough for her\Nto do cleaning and laundry in that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She seems super wary of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:21.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's the deal, Ines?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,And why do you have\NLady Lynneburg with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This house is kinda dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And who might this man be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gilbert, step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This person is a guest of Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Lady's guest, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.79,0:12:45.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then you're the one\Nwe've been speaking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure don't look like much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please stop being rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Also, you will accompany us\Nto the chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The more escorts the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.38,0:13:16.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That damn Deridas...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He doesn't give a damn about\Nthe non-aggression treaty or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,His previous request made that quite obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hand over all the rights to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.71,0:13:33.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I loan you my empire's military power,\Nit will be beneficial for you too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to avoid accepting\Nscummy offers that could lose me my nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll regret those words!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.71,0:13:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That may not be\Nthe only looming threat for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's finally time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:13:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're here, Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.29,0:14:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That guy is Lynne's dad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne, that's the Hermit's Cloak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you went outside?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I needed to find the person\Nwho saved my life myself, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes. This person is who rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry I've come here in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.29,0:14:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne really wanted to get here in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,How you're dressed doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for going to the trouble\Nof coming here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, I'm not an aristocrat\Nor anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know the proper etiquette\Nof places like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I may do something\Nconsidered impolite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, it's much easier\Nto speak with you if that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would like to formally show my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Without your actions,\Nmy daughter would be gone from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I truly thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,And just your words\Nare thanks enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right! Gratitude accepted.\NI'm heading to the baths then straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, sending a savior away\Nwithout reward is simply impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:27.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you'd like,\Nwhether land or money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will present to you\Nwhatever reward I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:31.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is there something you desire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I don't want anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you have no need for money nor land...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well then, how about\Nthe treasures from the dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our country possesses\Nthe world's oldest dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.33,0:15:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,All manners of rarities\Nhave been unearthed from there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,and are stored in the treasure hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can take about half of the items\Nstowed away there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.29,0:16:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,F-Father! That's insanely generous...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I don't want all that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:07.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really don't need any fancy thank-you gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What you said earlier\Nis way more than enough thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No need for treasures either, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.96,0:16:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then what could...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't sneak outta here...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that... a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look very good at first glance...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Father, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Rein.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,At this point, it has already become\Nnothing more than mere decoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:51.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is much better\Nthan just letting it lay here unused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one will even notice if I switch it out\Nfor the replica that was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's surprisingly heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is pretty priceless, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If so, I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:21.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no, I simply\Npicked it up on a journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and was using it because I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He picked it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's basically a hand-me-down.\NYou can accept something like that, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:34.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I graciously accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, would you like to give it a swing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Physical Enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's heavy, but not so much\Nthat I can't swing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well look at that,\Nyou can swing it one-handed, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You sure are a sturdy one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Also, about my daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you are all right with it,\Nwill you help toughen her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things are dangerous nowadays.\NI'm rather worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me, teach Lynne?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can teach her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,and that's something\Nshe should decide to do herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not good for parents to interfere\Ntoo much with their daughters, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,He sure does laugh a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I better head out soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry I kept you here so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:44.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,As Lynne's father,\NI want to thank you once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The heftiness is great for training, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:54.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel kinda like\NI got something very valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, this sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's about the same width\Nas the drain by Auntie Stella's house!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:04.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:04.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,This may do a better job
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This may do a better job
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,at getting the mud out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:07.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,at getting the mud out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.04,0:19:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll try it first thing tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We must talk.\NI'd like a little bit of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,First of all, I want you to allow me\Nto apologize for my rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,My demeanor was not appropriate\Nfor the one who saved Lady Lynneburg's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would very much like your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm not worried about that at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine, so lift your head up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.75,0:19:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for accepting my apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our job is to protect the people\Nof the Clays family from all dangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want you to understand that takes\Nprecedence over the way I treat guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you aren't a maid, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\NI have yet to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am Ines Harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am part of and serve as vice-captain\Nof the Clays family's warrior corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And from an early age,\NI've been known as "The Divine Shield."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was appointed to the role\Nof shield for Lady Lynneburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Primarily, I am who must protect her,\Neven if it costs me my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since you are the honorable person\Nwho saved her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,it is the same as you\Nsaving my life as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything that major...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,From here on,\NI will help you however I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you need anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The people who live here\Nsure are excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I'll go ahead\Nand accept the sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.75,0:20:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If anything ever comes up, I'll ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:47.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, let me warn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.54,0:20:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg seems\Nto have allowed your earlier attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but your speech and behavior while in\Naudience with the king was unpardonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.54,0:21:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are not permitted to take on\Nsuch a familiar manner as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:02.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should you continue on\Nlike this in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will no longer be able\Nto overlook your disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.71,0:21:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Refrain from doing so,\Nespecially in front of the retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:12.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks for the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is the only thing I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And, I'd also like to know\Nwho I am deeply indebted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,May I have your name, if you don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:28.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.21,0:21:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, did I do something wrong again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.33,0:21:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll be taking my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess I did make her mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Heading home already, Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.88,0:21:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's, uh... Gil... Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.13,0:21:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,No wait, Har...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.08,0:21:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Join me for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:56.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.75,0:22:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want you to show me\Nwhat you can really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.50,0:22:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't go home...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:10.63,Q2,,0,0,0,,#2: I Parry Rewards
